131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The paper compares YOLOv8 and Two-Stream CNN architectures for automatic accident detection in Bangladesh. Both models use bilateral filtering to minimize noise and preserve edge information. A personalized dataset was developed, and YOLOv8 performed better with 83.3% test accuracy compared to Two-Stream CNN's 74.0%. YOLOv8 also achieved better validation accuracy and class-wise metrics, with a higher precision and recall for Class 0 and Class 1 scenes. Despite having more parameters, YOLOv8 achieved the highest performance at 59 epochs, reaffirming its importance in accident detection systems. )
/E (The paper compares YOLOv8 and Two-Stream CNN architectures for automatic accident detection in Bangladesh. Both models use bilateral filtering to minimize noise and preserve edge information. A personalized dataset was developed, and YOLOv8 performed better with 83.3% test accuracy compared to Two-Stream CNN's 74.0%. YOLOv8 also achieved better validation accuracy and class-wise metrics, with a higher precision and recall for Class 0 and Class 1 scenes. Despite having more parameters, YOLOv8 achieved the highest performance at 59 epochs, reaffirming its importance in accident detection systems. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
